{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "c71a39f0-d5a2-4d1e-8e54-202610250001",
        "name": "Waai Media - Event Calendar API",
        "description": "Official Postman Collection (v2.1) for the Waai Media Event Calendar Module (Laravel 13 API Backend).\n\n### Authentication & Roles\n- **Public Endpoints**: No authentication required.\n- **Admin Endpoints**: Require Bearer token with 'access' ability (`admin` or `editor` role).\n- **Delete Endpoint**: Restricted strictly to `admin` role (returns HTTP 403 Forbidden for `editor`).\n\n### Date & Time Format\n- `event_date`: Strict `Y-m-d` format (e.g., `2026-11-20`).\n- `event_time`: Valid `H:i` or `H:i:s` format (e.g., `18:30` or `18:30:00`).\n\n### Cover Image Upload Contract\n- Supports multipart/form-data upload via `cover_image` (jpeg, jpg, png, webp, max 10MB).\n- Supports direct URL via `cover_image_url` (http/https URL or R2 storage key `events/covers/...`).\n\n### Collection Variables\n- `base_url`: Default `https://api.waaimedia.com`\n- `token`: Bearer access token for Admin or Editor\n- `event_id`: Persisted database ID\n- `slug`: Auto-generated or resolved event slug",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "base_url",
            "value": "https://api.waaimedia.com",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "event_id",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "slug",
            "value": "global-media-summit-2026-1",
            "type": "string"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "1. Public Events",
            "description": "Public read-only endpoints accessible without authentication.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1.1 List Published Events (Default 3 per page)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept-Language",
                                "value": "en",
                                "description": "Language negotiation (ar or en). Determines localized field resolution."
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/events?timeline=upcoming&page=1&per_page=3",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v1",
                                "events"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "timeline",
                                    "value": "upcoming",
                                    "description": "Timeline filter: upcoming (default), past, latest, all"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "category",
                                    "value": "Media",
                                    "disabled": true,
                                    "description": "Free-text category filter (matches category_en or category_ar)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "per_page",
                                    "value": "3",
                                    "description": "Pagination limit (defaults to 3 for public website)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "page",
                                    "value": "1",
                                    "description": "Page number"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Lists published events. Only events with status='published' and published_at <= now() are returned. Defaults to 3 events per page sorted chronologically for upcoming timeline."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "1.2 Get Published Event Details by Slug",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept-Language",
                                "value": "en",
                                "description": "Language negotiation (ar or en)"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/events/{{slug}}",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "v1",
                                "events",
                                "{{slug}}"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Retrieves a single published event by its unique immutable slug. Draft events or nonexistent slugs return HTTP 404 Not Found."
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ]
        },
